  "releaseNotes": "V 1.15.0\n          - Transaction received origin source to transaction source and match public api names\n          V 1.14.0\n          - Transaction received with origin source \n          V 1.13.0\n          - Added banking.bulk_payment.status.updated event\n          V 1.12.0\n          - Added banking.account.status.updated event\n          V 1.11.0\n          - Added banking.mandate.updated event\n          V 1.10.0\n          - Added banking.mandate.created event\n          V 1.9.0\n          - Added banking.mandate.status.updated event\n\t\t  V 1.8.0\n\t\t  - Added banking.account.approval_settings.updated event\n\t\t  V 1.7.0\n\t\t  - Added banking.payment.authorized event\n          V 1.6.0\n          - Add net9.0 and remove net6.0 support.\n          V 1.5.3\n          - Added TppMessages to payment events\n          V 1.5.2\n          - SourceCurrency, ExchangeRate and TransactionAmount set to required for banking.account.transaction.received event.\n          V 1.5.1\n          - Added Charge, CurrencyExchange and AmountDetails to banking.account.transaction.received event\n          V 1.5.0\n          - Added links to payment events\n          V 1.4.1\n          - New references, debtor and creditor fields added for banking.account.transaction.received event\n          V 1.4.0\n          - New remittance fields and payment references, old remittances deprecated\n\t\t  V 1.3.1\n\t\t  - BalanceAmount and TransactionAmount value property renamed from Value to Amount\n\t\t  V 1.2.1\n\t\t  - Added InstructionId to banking.account.transaction.received event\n\t\t  V 1.2.0\n\t\t  - Added banking.account.balance.updated event\n\t\t  - Added banking.account.transaction.received event\n\t\t  V 1.1.0\n\t\t  - Added EndToEndIdentification to PaymentStatusUpdated event\n\t\t  - Added xml docs\n\t\t  V 1.0.0\n\t\t  - Added banking.account.created Event\n\t\t  - Added banking.payment.status.updated Event",
